sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as Release owner
    participant UI as Flag console
    participant CP as Flag control plane
    participant K as Change stream
    participant SDK as Service SDK
    participant App as Request path
    Op->>UI: set flag to 5% of members
    UI->>CP: write rule with targeting
    CP->>CP: validate and version the rule
    CP->>K: publish change
    K->>SDK: push to every instance
    SDK->>SDK: refresh local cache
    Note over SDK: evaluation is local — no network call per request
    App->>SDK: isEnabled(flag, member)
    SDK-->>App: decision from the cached rule
    alt SDK cannot reach the control plane
        SDK-->>App: last known rule, then the compiled default
    end
